    "description": "===== Highlights =====\r\n<b>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fAntivirus & File Scan</b>\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf2aJunk Cleaner</b>\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcf7Image Cleaner</b>\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd10AppLock</b>\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd0dWiFi Security</b>\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcecNotification Manager</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fAntivirus & File Scan</b>\r\n\uf06c\tVirus scan and remove to keep your phone away from the malwares, spywares and Trojans.\r\n\uf06c\tSuper Antivirus can also scan installed apps and downloaded files.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\ude80Junk Cleaner </b>\r\n\uf06c\tClean cache and residual files to free up and get more storage space.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd10AppLock</b>\r\n\uf06c\tLock apps easily & quickly with Pattern, Fingerprint, and passcode.\r\n\uf06c\tFingerprint lock works only with devices running Android 6.0 or higher and fingerprint sensor support.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd0dWiFi Security</b>\r\n\uf06c\tDetect current WiFi connection to keep your phone safe from insecure public WiFi. \r\n\uf06c\tDetect intruders when connecting WiFi, ensure your network safety whenever, wherever.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcecNotification Manager</b>\r\n\uf06c\tBlock annoying useless notifications, you can use notification blocker now to get rid of junk notifications from jamming.\r\n\r\nDownload the antivirus & security app that\u2019s intuitively designed to protect your mobile in just ONE tap.",
